This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page three of the [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond#Page 3|Helldivers Mobilize!]] [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|5|notext}} and 2 [[Medal]]s.

